        "description": "Positive family history consistent with autosomal dominant inheritance",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all three major criteria: cardiac anomalies, short stature, and joint hypermobility",
    "notes": "Facial dysmorphism supports diagnosis but is not mandatory. Genetic testing may assist but is not definitive."
